# The 77 selected original WOW32 bodies, original `wow32.def`, resource and
# historical source manifest remain canonical under src/mvdm/wow32/.  This
# manifest owns only the standalone bindings that must reside in the late-
# loaded DLL and import their worker-local state through ntvdm.exe's narrow
# ABI.

